        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hot water tank factory</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hot water tank factory
Production plant with an annual capacity of 1000 tanks and a life time of 50 years.;
UUID: 93f68195-fad9-31da-a551-ef1ee9ccbb6f
Building, land occupation and transformation of a factory for hot water tanks and storages. Not including machinery.
Location: Production plant in CH.
Technology: Medium sized production plant for different types of boilers and tanks.
Time period: Material data have been investigated for a collector produced in 2002. Data for energy uses during production have been investigated for 2001.
Production volume: Production volume 1000 units per year.
Sampling: Questionnaires. 
Extrapolations: Data of one factory used for CH. Energy use extrapolated by weight for 2000l storage.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_93f68195-fad9-31da-a551-ef1ee9ccbb6f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
